{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_plans_2026_05_20_full_stack_review", "label": "Full-stack review \u2014 2026-05-20", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-05-20-full-stack-review.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_05_20_full_stack_review_c1_publishevent_silent_failure", "label": "C1 \u2014 publishEvent ignored RLS denials (silent failure)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-05-20-full-stack-review.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": ".update().eq() returns 0 affected rows when an organizer tries to publish another organizer's event, but the action returned success and revalidated \u2014 pure silent failure. Fixed by chaining .select('id').maybeSingle() and throwing when data is null."}, {"id": "docs_plans_2026_05_20_full_stack_review_c4_proxy_signout_cookie_bug", "label": "C4 \u2014 proxy signOut() cookie/response-object mismatch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-05-20-full-stack-review.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "signOut() wrote clear-cookies to res, but the function returned a different NextResponse.redirect() object, so the browser stayed signed in and the next visit triggered an infinite redirect loop. Fixed via a redirectWithCookies() helper that copies res.cookies onto the redirect \u2014 same bug class as the /auth/callback fix."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_plans_2026_05_20_full_stack_review", "target": "docs_plans_2026_05_20_full_stack_review_c1_publishevent_silent_failure", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/plans/2026-05-20-full-stack-review.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_plans_2026_05_20_full_stack_review", "target